{"id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-structure.md","title":"Structure","display":"df-structure — Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-structure","aliases":["17-df-structure"],"display":"df-structure — Structure","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"source_section":"1.3","source_pages_print":[19,20],"source_pages_djvu":[35,36],"source_verification":"statement-compared; interpretation-domain explicit","label_origin":"local-catalog","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span><span>20</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>35</span><span>36</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; interpretation-domain explicit"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>载体与解释投影仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> 使用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Set}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Set}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(A\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span> (candidate universe)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\)</span> (symbol components of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 是候选解释函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\{\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I):\\;&amp;\nA\\in\\mathrm{Set}\\land A\\neq\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal I:\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\to A\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(A^{A^n}\\cup\\mathcal P(A^n))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(\\mathcal I(c)\\in A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;(\\mathcal I(f):A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;(\\mathcal I(R)\\subseteq A^n)\n\\bigr\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\nc^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(c),\\qquad\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(f),\\qquad\nR^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\{\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I):\\;&amp;\nA\\in\\mathrm{Set}\\land A\\neq\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal I:\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\to A\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(A^{A^n}\\cup\\mathcal P(A^n))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(\\mathcal I(c)\\in A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;(\\mathcal I(f):A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;(\\mathcal I(R)\\subseteq A^n)\n\\bigr\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\nc^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(c),\\qquad\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(f),\\qquad\nR^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>载体、解释函数的定义域及各元数解释均由本文件直接给出。同构和部分同构使用本册的语言分量，不再通过缺失的外部总字母表假定一个结构编码桥接。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ (first-order language, see [[17-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}$ (symbol components of $L$, see [[17-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal I$ 是候选解释函数；$\\operatorname{Sym}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\neq\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\{\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I):\\;&\nA\\in\\mathrm{Set}\\land A\\neq\\emptyset\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathcal I:\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\to A\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(A^{A^n}\\cup\\mathcal P(A^n))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(\\mathcal I(c)\\in A)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;(\\mathcal I(f):A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;(\\mathcal I(R)\\subseteq A^n)\n\\bigr\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|&\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\nc^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(c),\\qquad\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(f),\\qquad\nR^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathcal I(R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2184,"backlinks":[{"id":"48d3ae3ee6d03d67","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，语言、结构及一阶句子真值见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]、[[17-df-structure]]、[[17-df-sentence-truth]]；同构见 [[17-df-isomorphism]]。$\\mathscr L,\\mathscr L_1,\\mathscr L_2$ 是固定的语义接口：对每个 $L\\in\\mathcal V$，$S_{\\mathscr L}(L)$ 是句子编码的一个集合；$E_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\mathfrak M,\\sigma)$ 是在 $\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$\\sigma\\in S_{\\mathscr L}(L)$ 上给定的二值谓词。它们是固定的可定义类参数；下式是关于这些接口的元理论模式，不把全语言上的赋值误作一个集合，也不量化一个 ZFC 内部真谓词。$\\Gamma$ 为句子集合。$\\mathrm{FO}$ 是由下式完全指定的一阶语义接口。"},{"id":"b93c3fbca33bcd2e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"352c517d01805926","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"caec72ff0a2438f3","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"ba828dd62ddf0d50","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L,L')$，$\\mathrm{Const}_{L'}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L}$，$\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Func}_{L',n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})$；见 [[17-df-reduct]]。$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]。"},{"id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$I$ 是集合，${<}\\subseteq I\\times I$ 是候选严格序。\n$F$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的集合函数，$\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)$；$\\mathfrak B$ 是候选结构。\n$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 及载体投影见 [[17-df-structure]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]。\n$\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}$ 见 [[17-df-linear-order]]；族 $(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 采用该依赖链中的函数图编码。"},{"id":"041b10825d75f464","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"90228ad7fbdc5179","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ 及总字母表 $\\Sigma_L$ 见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]；$\\mathfrak A=(|\\mathfrak A|,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。对每个 $a\\in|\\mathfrak A|$，令 $c_a=\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)$，其中 $\\operatorname{Name}_L$ 是 [[17-df-language-constants]] 中已定义的规范新名字函数。$L(C)$ 取 [[17-df-language-constants]] 的常元扩张，$\\upharpoonright L$ 取 [[17-df-reduct]] 的语言约化。原子公式集 $\\mathrm{AtomForm}_{L(\\mathfrak A)}$、句子集 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak A)}$ 与句子真值 $\\models$ 分别见 [[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-sentence]]、[[17-df-sentence-truth]]。以下定义 $C_{\\mathfrak A}$、$L(\\mathfrak A)$、规范命名扩张 $\\mathfrak A_{\\mathfrak A}$ 和 $\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)$。"},{"id":"7ba09ad1e61f0c97","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 为固定的可定义类，见 [[17-df-structure]]。类记号及 $\\operatorname{AP}_L(\\mathcal K)$ 是对其定义式逐次展开的元语言模式；量词 $\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K$、$\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K$ 仅约束集合编码的结构，不量化类对象。"},{"id":"f14193aff07acd49","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{B}_2$ ($L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"9a564fd35615a768","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$I$ 为集合，${<}\\subseteq I\\times I$ 为候选关系。\n$F$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的集合函数，$\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)$；$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。\n$\\preceq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；$\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}$ 见 [[17-df-linear-order]]。\n$\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L$ 的定义包括索引序与各分量的类型检验；此谓词允许空索引集。"},{"id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为语言；$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]；$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 见 [[17-df-formula]]；总赋值集 $\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)$ 及 $\\mathrm{Sat}_L$ 见 [[17-df-assignment]]、[[17-df-satisfaction]]。$f\\circ s$ 是通常的函数复合。此处定义初等嵌入集合 $\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$。"},{"id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}$ ($L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}$ ($L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[17-df-first-order-language]] 的一阶语言，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。\n常元、函数和关系符号分量分别为 $\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}$；$f\\circ\\bar a$ 是逐分量施加 $f$ 所得的 $n$ 元组。$f$ 为候选集合函数图；以下定义三元谓词 $\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$。"},{"id":"5dbb6e8d985aff7a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}$ ($L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ (class of $L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"bfb69740eadd1eee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"49d62977f4c49d09","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9c54640eb3282127","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"5a712e15961f1e3d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aa3ceab2a7aa2799","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3ed1bbae3ef8ad9