lter}_I(D)$，见 [[17-df-filter]]。$\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;\\mathcal A,I,V)$ 的参数依次是输出集合、载体族、指标集、载体族的目标集合（陪域），见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。$\\mathcal A,V,P,\\sim_D,[f]_D,Q_D$ 是下式定义的对象；$f,g\\in P$ 时使用 $f\\sim_Dg$、$[f]_D$。$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选 $L$-结构。以下定义 $\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$，元组 $\\bar f\\in P^n$ 的第 $j$ 个分量记作 $\\bar f(j)$。"},{"id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；变量、逻辑、常元及逐元数函数/关系分量 $\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Log}_L,\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}$（以及 $L'$ 的对应分量）取 [[17-df-first-order-language]] 的投影；$\\operatorname{Sym}(L)$ 取 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]。$\\mathfrak B=(B,\\mathcal J)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L')$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。$\\mathcal J\\upharpoonright X$ 为集合函数对定义域子集的通常限制。以下定义子语言谓词 $\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L,L')$；$\\operatorname{Reduct}_{L',L}$ 是仅在该谓词成立的语言对上定义的可定义类函数，其输入域为 $\\mathrm{Structure}(L')$，值域为 $\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。$\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright L$ 是同一输出的记号。"},{"id":"96c9d29d955fafcf","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；$\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$，分别见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]、[[17-df-structure]]、[[17-df-assignment]]。项、公式及项解释分别见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-term-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"c5a802b85ee03d3e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$, see [[17-df-structure]])"},{"id":"10fd1dfc88760f5b","anchor":"ref-9","lo